    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "f4e041cc24aaf2af515d948dae9bcd98",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Initial averages and the ghost subtraction</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each result includes the incoming quark spin average and the initial color\nfactor <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(1/[N_c(N_c^2-1)]||)</marimo-tex>. The covariant calculation includes unphysical\ngluon modes. Subtract both generated ghost channels before averaging the\ntwo physical incoming gluon polarizations:\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\overline{|\\mathcal M|^2}=\\tfrac12\n(|\\mathcal M_{\\rm cov}|^2-|\\mathcal M_{\\rm gh}|^2-|\\mathcal M_{\\rm anti\\,gh}|^2).||)</marimo-tex>$\nEach ghost contribution before that last factor is\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(g_s^4(m^2-u)(s-m^2)/(2t^2)||)</marimo-tex>. It is nonzero; a covariant sum alone does not\nreproduce the physical rate.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">At <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m=0||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N_c=3||)</marimo-tex>, the physical result is</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[g_s^4(s^2+u^2)\\left(\\frac1{t^2}-\\frac4{9su}\\right).||]</marimo-tex></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
